{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1410137-the-purview-of-forces","id":1410137,"title":"The purview of Forces","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-24T15:16:14-07:00","id":1410137,"title":"The purview of Forces","content":"One of my favorite things about Mage is the flexibility of the spellcasting system, each Arcanum encompasses a wealth of possibilities and each have a part of their purview whose application is not apparent at first glance. One example is intentions for Fate, which could allow you to read a person's Aspirations and Obsessions, mask how others perceive those intentions, changing the conditions needed to realize them and more.<br /> <br /> Space has the nature of emotional connections, understanding and changing their nature, such as making a trusting confidant into a hated enemy. Inverting its spells can also be interesting. A reverse Isolation makes you harder to detain or attack, an inverted Break Boundary brings something to you. Spirit really opens up when you realize just about anything besides people has one, including cars, mountains, animals, etc.<br /> <br /> But Forces is one for which I haven't quite groked how to create new ones. To review, it stated purview encompasses electricity, gravity, sound, light, heat, fire, weather and movement.<br /> <br /> Seismic vision, echolocation and all such spells are covered by Nightvision. Far sight is covered by Zoom In, which oddly enough is Ruling rather than Unveiling. Spider climb can be attributed to Control Gravity. Blinding light, hypo and hyperthermia via Ruling. Energy redirection is done via Turn Momentum, which is a Weaving rather than Ruling.<br /> <br /> The printed spells cover such a huge variety that I find it the most difficult Arcanum to come up with new ones, especially for the first two dots.<br /> <br /> So I wanted to ask: what sort of Forces spells have been used in your games ? What kind of unorthodox ones did you see ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-24-2020, 08:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T18:33:41-07:00","id":1410176,"title":"","content":"In my game Forces 2 allows for basically unrestricted control of any computer system: Ruling, Potency Primary, Potency = complexity of action. So a potency 2 <i>Control Computers</i> spell could make an availability 2 program or accomplish something that someone with Computers 2 could accomplish, but instantaneously, and because the spell is just nudging bits to be a 1 or 0 the effect is lasting (or as lasting as the memory to which it is written, if you put it in RAM and turn off the computer then it's gone).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T19:13:52-07:00","id":1410184,"title":"","content":"Interesting, so you could create an AI for a turret of robot instantly. It allows improvisation of hacking software, make big changes in a database after downloading its content, immediately upgrading your security firewall as you research a topic the Seers are monitoring. Overall a very versatile spell..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-29T10:21:18-07:00","id":1411009,"title":"","content":"Using magnetism you can easily unlock any door made of metal.<br /> <br /> I don't know if you could use forces to phase through walls and such by controlling the vibrations of your cells, like the Flash does.<br /> <br /> Forces could also conceivably be used as a very crude form of mind control by using light to control neurons of living beings (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Optogenetics\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Optogenetics</a>).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9849,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","user":"Aristarkos","date":". 08-29-2020, 01:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-29T14:51:01-07:00","id":1411025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_pos